    <section class="aqven-problem" aria-labelledby="aqven-problem-title">
      <div class="aqven-container aqven-problem__grid">
        <div>
          <h2 id="aqven-problem-title">A workflow can finish and still fail the customer.</h2>
          <p>It can use the wrong context, take an unsafe route, or regress after a small change. “It ran” is not enough evidence.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="aqven-problem__answer">AQVEN makes AI-powered work reviewable and improvable.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="aqven-studio" id="studio" aria-labelledby="aqven-studio-title">
      <div class="aqven-container">
        <div class="aqven-section-heading">
          <h2 id="aqven-studio-title">When an AI result is wrong, know why.</h2>
          <p>Studio connects the result a customer received to the run, the workflow decision, and the evaluation that protects the next change.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="aqven-evidence">
          <div class="aqven-evidence__steps">
            <article class="aqven-evidence__step">
              <p>01</p>
              <h3>Start with the run.</h3>
              <span>See the exact inputs, result, cost, and path behind a customer outcome.</span>
            </article>
            <article class="aqven-evidence__step">
              <p>02</p>
              <h3>Find the first divergence.</h3>
              <span>Trace the result to the model, context, tool, or decision that changed the path.</span>
            </article>
            <article class="aqven-evidence__step">
              <p>03</p>
              <h3>Prove the next change.</h3>
              <span>Turn the failure into a representative case and test it before it reaches another customer.</span>
            </article>
            <a class="aqven-inline-link" href="/studio/">Explore Studio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>

          <div class="aqven-evidence__media" aria-label="AQVEN Studio evidence views">
            <figure class="aqven-evidence__run">
              <figcaption>Run</figcaption>
              <img src="/images/studio/runs.png" width="1080" height="315" alt="AQVEN Studio Runs view showing run cost, duration, tokens, and completed nodes." loading="lazy" />
            </figure>
            <figure class="aqven-evidence__eval">
              <figcaption>Evaluation</figcaption>
              <img src="/images/studio/evaluations.png" width="1080" height="720" alt="AQVEN Studio Evaluations view showing an evaluation target, scorers, dataset, and policy." loading="lazy" />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

